# Experience job order

Always keep employers in reverse-chronological order (latest first, oldest last). Never reorder jobs by relevance to the JD.

Correct order:

1. Meazure Learning (Sep 2025 – Present)
2. Infobyte Tech Solutions (Aug 2023 – Mar 2025)
3. Becton Dickinson / BD (Feb 2020 – Aug 2023)
4. Softprodigy (Aug 2017 – Aug 2019)

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD — BD jumped above Infobyte for healthcare relevance -->
### Meazure Learning
### Becton Dickinson
### Infobyte Tech Solutions

<!-- ✅ GOOD — dates decide order; tailor bullets inside each job instead -->
### Meazure Learning
### Infobyte Tech Solutions
### Becton Dickinson
### Softprodigy
```

You may reorder bullets within a job and emphasize Skills/Summary for the JD. Do not move employers.
